Name: UKCP18 Regional climate projections
Description: A set of 16 regional climate projections for the UK and North-West Europe at 12 km spatial resolution. The set comprises 12 models from the Met Office Hadley Centre Perturbed Physics Ensemble (PPE) and 4 models from other international modelling centres (CMIP5). The projections are available for the period 1981-2080 under the RCP8.5 emissions scenario. The regional projections are available at UK-scale (land-gcm(uk)) at daily, monthly, seasonal and annual temporal resolutions on a 12km OSGB grid, for major UK river catchments, regions and each of the countries of the United Kingdom. This data is also available for North-West Europe at daily and monthly temporal resolutions. The data has been converted to cloud-optimised Zarr v3 data stores.
